    "description": "Owns and operates a Houston dealership and builds the systems that run it: a custom dealership CRM with its Handle a Sale desk (one system), an inbound voice AI that books appointments into the CRM, and a prospecting workflow that researches leads with the Claude API and writes findings to the CRM. Also founded Obavia, a dealership sale desk in development for Texas independent dealers.",
