  "description": "Jason Obawemimo owns and operates Triple J Auto Investment, a Houston dealership, and builds the CRM, voice AI and automation systems that run it. Since June 2025 he has personally closed 53 vehicle sales and collected $206,777 in sale proceeds. He is also the founder of Obavia, a dealership sale desk in development for Texas independent dealers.",
  "disambiguatingDescription": "Pearland, Texas owner and operator of Triple J Auto Investment in Houston, where he builds the CRM, voice AI and automation systems that run the dealership, and founder of Obavia (spelled O-B-A-V-I-A), a dealership sale desk in development for Texas independent dealers. Obawemimo is his family name.",
